+        vma_start_write_new_api)
+            #
+            # Determine if the per-VMA write lock can be taken using the
+            # single-argument __is_vma_write_locked() and
+            # __vma_raw_mm_seqnum() helpers.
+            #
+            # The VMA refcount based locking was reworked: VMA_LOCK_OFFSET
+            # was replaced by VM_REFCNT_EXCLUDE_READERS_FLAG and
+            # __is_vma_write_locked() no longer returns the mmap lock
